    <node id="人民币普通股(A股)">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">在中国发行的每股市值为1.00元的普通股。&lt;SEP&gt;Type of shares to be issued by Wuhan Xingtu Xinke Electronics Co.,Ltd.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-0d3b82cfbf6772af3c5c482b184ed05d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8d5cebe940c9dcdb12babed33459bead-chunk-000</data>
