    <node id="武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司">
      <data key="d0">organization</data>
      <data key="d1">兴图新科has become an important supplier in the national defense military video command field. Its video command and control products are command and control subsystems/submodules in the national defense command information system (equivalent to the U.S. C4ISR system). 兴图新科participated in formulating the first military video command system technical standard and independently undertook the design, development, research, and deployment of the video command subsystem in a large integrated intelligence, command, control, and communications network project. 兴图新科has 200 R&amp;D personnel, 31 patents (inclu</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-04bc0b323a0a1cdd8680a9214a36edd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5b954fbdfaecacdf00721af6b76aff-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3463c31953d6de42e9ad865c367376ea-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-341185c2a9fbde33b2c43c4a6aef449a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6d93e49a228bee557a4870df2afd79ef-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ca3e5f680866acd0a91f5ba26add99-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="维盛网域">
      <data key="d0">organization</data>
      <data key="d1">维盛网域(北京维盛网域科技有限公司) is a competitor in the national defense command field. 维盛网域was founded in 2000 and is located in Haidian District, Beijing. 维盛网域is a comprehensive enterprise integrating video communications, industrial automation, and environmental protection; some civilian products have been exported to Singapore and North Korea. 维盛网域's main products include security monitoring systems, industrial site monitoring systems, television conferencing systems, multimedia teaching systems, and traffic management systems.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-04bc0b323a0a1cdd8680a9214a36edd0-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="飞讯数码">
      <data key="d0">organization</data>
      <data key="d1">飞讯数码(北京飞讯数码科技有限公司) is a competitor in the national defense command field. 飞讯数码was founded in 2004 and was acquired by东土科技on May 26, 2016. 飞讯数码is headquartered in Beijing Zhongguancun and focuses on the design, development, production, and technical services for military audio/video information systems, providing video command and dispatch and video surveillance system products.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-04bc0b323a0a1cdd8680a9214a36edd0-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="东土科技">
      <data key="d0">organization</data>
      <data key="d1">东土科技(北京东土科技股份有限公司) is a listed company with stock code 300353 that acquired飞讯数码on May 26, 2016.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-04bc0b323a0a1cdd8680a9214a36edd0-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="淳中科技">
      <data key="d0">organization</data>
      <data key="d1">淳中科技(北京淳中科技股份有限公司, stock code 603516) is a competitor in the national defense command field and a provider of display and control system equipment and solutions. 淳中科技's main products are divided into equipment and platform categories, including image processing equipment, matrix switching equipment, signal transmission equipment, digital video comprehensive platforms, and display and control collaboration platforms. 淳中科技's products are mainly used in command and control centers, conference rooms, and display and other multimedia video scenarios, mainly applied in military, political, economic,</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-04bc0b323a0a1cdd8680a9214a36edd0-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="国防指挥领域">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">A business domain in which兴图新科's main competitors include维盛网域, 飞讯数码, and淳中科技, and in which兴图新科faces frequent head-on competition with same-industry enterprises.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-04bc0b323a0a1cdd8680a9214a36edd0-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="市政、工程领域">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">A business domain with smaller scale, mainly distributed in local regions, where兴图新科does not have competitive relationships with same-industry enterprises.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-04bc0b323a0a1cdd8680a9214a36edd0-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
