    <node id="国防指挥信息系统">
      <data key="d0">artifact</data>
      <data key="d1">A system equivalent to the U.S. C4ISR system. 兴图新科's video command and control products are the command and control subsystem and submodules within国防指挥信息系统, playing important command and control roles.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-04bc0b323a0a1cdd8680a9214a36edd0-chunk-000</data>
