      <data key="d0">content</data>
      <data key="d1">The first military video command system technical standard, in whose formulation兴图新科participated.&lt;SEP&gt;Specific video technical specification that constitutes the first military video command system technical standard.&lt;SEP&gt;The first video command system technical standard of the entire military, in whose formulation兴图新科participated.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-04bc0b323a0a1cdd8680a9214a36edd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0df17702da72d10a3a7f47e7226b5dac-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-341185c2a9fbde33b2c43c4a6aef449a-chunk-000</data>
