    <node id="某情报、指挥、控制与通信网络一体化工程">
      <data key="d0">event</data>
      <data key="d1">A large integrated intelligence, command, control, and communications network project led by a large research institute, equivalent to the U.S. C4ISR system. 兴图新科independently undertook the design, development, research, and deployment of the video command subsystem of某情报、指挥、控制与通信网络一体化工程, and the project as a whole won the first prize of the National Science and Technology Progress Award.&lt;SEP&gt;Project led by某大型研究所and equivalent to the US C4ISR system; the company independently undertook the video command subsystem.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-04bc0b323a0a1cdd8680a9214a36edd0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0df17702da72d10a3a7f47e7226b5dac-chunk-000</data>
