    <node id="Core Technical Personnel">
      <data key="d0">other</data>
      <data key="d1">Group of employees at the company who sign confidentiality agreements, whose work-related intellectual property belongs to the company, and who must maintain confidentiality of technical and business secrets after leaving.</data>
