    <node id="Audio-Video Integrated Service Platform">
      <data key="d0">artifact</data>
      <data key="d1">The Audio-Video Integrated Service Platform is a system whose components can dynamically join or exit according to changes in the usage environment, with flexibly configurable information relationships among functional nodes.&lt;SEP&gt;A platform independently developed by Xingtu Xinke that can flexibly and quickly build matching audio-video integrated service systems for different industries, customers, and different periods of the same customer, with strong environmental adaptability, business applicability, and scalability.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-3463c31953d6de42e9ad865c367376ea-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f65d014acc6991a87f34af637ace18b5-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Four-Follow Service">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">The Four-Follow Service is a service philosophy upheld by兴图新科, including on-call service support, ready stock support, on-demand product customization, and continuous upgrades following new developments.&lt;SEP&gt;A service philosophy strictly implemented by兴图新科: service support on call, stock support on demand, product customization on request, and continuous upgrades with new developments. Four-Follow Service meets military requirements for rapid, efficient, standardized, and systematic support.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-3463c31953d6de42e9ad865c367376ea-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-341185c2a9fbde33b2c43c4a6aef449a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Plug and Play">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">Plug and Play refers to the ability of system components to dynamically access military information infrastructure at any time and place and quickly obtain and use required network, data, and service resources.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-3463c31953d6de42e9ad865c367376ea-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Flexible Reorganization">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">Flexible Reorganization refers to a system's dynamic reconfiguration capability, allowing rapid and flexible expansion, trimming, and reorganization of components according to combat tasks, battlefield environment, and damage to combat units.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-3463c31953d6de42e9ad865c367376ea-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="On-Demand Service">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">On-Demand Service refers to a system's ability to flexibly organize and generate communication, computing, information, and software resources required by users and to provide resource services quickly, reasonably, and efficiently.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-3463c31953d6de42e9ad865c367376ea-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Military">
      <data key="d0">organization</data>
      <data key="d1">Military refers to military customers and organizations that act as downstream end users in the electronic information industry and form a key customer group for the Company’s products. These customers highly recognize 兴图新科’s product technical strength and service support capabilities, and they require continuous maintenance, upgrades, and updates of military products. Military units or overall units serving the military also require rapid, efficient, standardized, and systematic technical support and after-sales service for military product sales.

The military generally uses a budget managem</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-3463c31953d6de42e9ad865c367376ea-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-341185c2a9fbde33b2c43c4a6aef449a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-60a51f5046e89b8028c2464899fc67ff-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7367e55b26e24899655b70b4bf8396f2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6d93e49a228bee557a4870df2afd79ef-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c54e44446e7b57bba54a81c9ed3175f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afb452c25941d560d1baf469f525d4a8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b1410d4ad6e0804838e4f5c1cca353e2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="People's Liberation Army">
      <data key="d0">organization</data>
      <data key="d1">The People's Liberation Army is the Chinese military, whose 90th anniversary parade was supported by兴图新科and for which兴图新科received a contribution award.&lt;SEP&gt;The Chinese military organization referred to in the names of the 70th anniversary victory parade and the 90th anniversary Zhurihe parade, as well as in the parade support award received by The Company.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-3463c31953d6de42e9ad865c367376ea-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b1410d4ad6e0804838e4f5c1cca353e2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Military Competent Departments">
      <data key="d0">organization</data>
      <data key="d1">Military Competent Departments are military departments with which兴图新科has established long-term cooperative relationships.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-3463c31953d6de42e9ad865c367376ea-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Research Institutes">
      <data key="d0">organization</data>
      <data key="d1">Research Institutes are relevant research institutions with which兴图新科has established long-term cooperative relationships.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-3463c31953d6de42e9ad865c367376ea-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="National Defense System">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">The National Defense System is the defense framework into which military products are integrated after commissioning, requiring security, stability, and timely supply to maintain military combat effectiveness.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-3463c31953d6de42e9ad865c367376ea-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Military Products">
      <data key="d0">artifact</data>
      <data key="d1">Military Products are products that, once commissioned, integrate into the national defense system and require continuous maintenance, upgrades, and updates by suppliers.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-3463c31953d6de42e9ad865c367376ea-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Regulations on the Administration of Weaponry and Equipment R&amp;D and Production Licensing">
      <data key="d0">content</data>
      <data key="d1">The Regulations on the Administration of Weaponry and Equipment R&amp;D and Production Licensing are regulations that require enterprises engaged in military product R&amp;D and production to obtain state secrecy qualifications and weaponry and equipment R&amp;D and production qualifications.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-3463c31953d6de42e9ad865c367376ea-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Measures for the Administration of Security Qualification Review and Certification of Weaponry and Equipment R&amp;D and Production Units">
      <data key="d0">content</data>
      <data key="d1">The Measures for the Administration of Security Qualification Review and Certification of Weaponry and Equipment R&amp;D and Production Units are regulations that require enterprises engaged in military product R&amp;D and production to obtain state secrecy qualifications and weaponry and equipment R&amp;D and production qualifications.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-3463c31953d6de42e9ad865c367376ea-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="State Secrecy Qualification">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">State Secrecy Qualification is a qualification required by regulations for enterprises engaged in military product R&amp;D and production.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-3463c31953d6de42e9ad865c367376ea-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Weaponry and Equipment R&amp;D and Production Qualification">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">Weaponry and Equipment R&amp;D and Production Qualification is a qualification required by regulations for enterprises engaged in military product R&amp;D and production and for military suppliers.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-3463c31953d6de42e9ad865c367376ea-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Weaponry and Equipment R&amp;D and Production Unit Secrecy Qualification Certificate">
      <data key="d0">content</data>
      <data key="d1">The Weaponry and Equipment R&amp;D and Production Unit Secrecy Qualification Certificate is a certificate obtained by兴图新科.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-3463c31953d6de42e9ad865c367376ea-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Weaponry and Equipment R&amp;D and Production License">
      <data key="d0">content</data>
