      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Reference Design Solution">
      <data key="d0">artifact</data>
      <data key="d1">A reference design solution designed for customers according to their actual needs and used to drive sales.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-46919d0eebd23265d0e4a36c8561e953-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="R&amp;D Center">
      <data key="d0">artifact</data>
      <data key="d1">A research and development center that力源信息needs to establish to further strengthen its technical strength.&lt;SEP&gt;A proposed investment project with a planned total investment of RMB 15.2638 million.&lt;SEP&gt;A fundraising investment project of the Company.&lt;SEP&gt;An R&amp;D center under the Market Development Department, responsible for selecting R&amp;D projects aligned with company resources and market demand, developing or co-developing product solutions with customers, providing technical support for solution promotion, project management, technology, results and patents, R&amp;D outcome and related materials m</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-46919d0eebd23265d0e4a36c8561e953-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-62ddc7521474f545b02b4e88438a1830-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a09a8520c26b02641cf8ce8a941b417a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b97086859d642e3a0f057e35a541909f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e734598bf50937d11d9e436da2ec95a8-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Electronic Product Sales Platform">
      <data key="d0">artifact</data>
      <data key="d1">A sales platform for electronic products that will be an electronic and networked platform, and that must combine services satisfying all customer needs to have strong vitality.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-46919d0eebd23265d0e4a36c8561e953-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Electronic Product">
      <data key="d0">artifact</data>
      <data key="d1">An electronic product, especially IC products, that requires support from many materials, technologies, and supply chain guarantees.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-46919d0eebd23265d0e4a36c8561e953-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="IC Product">
      <data key="d0">artifact</data>
      <data key="d1">An IC product that requires support from materials, technology, and supply chain guarantees, with substantial early-stage selection, evaluation, and trial work and later-stage supply guarantees.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-46919d0eebd23265d0e4a36c8561e953-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Long-Term Supply">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">A later-stage supply guarantee for IC products, important because changes in IC models affect overall product performance.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-46919d0eebd23265d0e4a36c8561e953-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Timely Supply">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">A later-stage supply guarantee for IC products, necessary because a lack of any component prevents products from coming off the line smoothly.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-46919d0eebd23265d0e4a36c8561e953-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Complete Product Line">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">A product line with complete model availability, serving as the basic premise for satisfying customer needs.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-46919d0eebd23265d0e4a36c8561e953-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Technical Strength">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">A company's own technical strength, which is the basis for transmitting new products and new technologies, designing reference design solutions, and providing technical support.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-46919d0eebd23265d0e4a36c8561e953-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Sales">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">Sales driven by reference design solutions, occupying an important position in company operations.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-46919d0eebd23265d0e4a36c8561e953-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Supply Chain Support">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">Supply chain support that electronic products, especially IC products, require alongside materials and technology.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-46919d0eebd23265d0e4a36c8561e953-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Customer Need">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">All customer needs that a sales platform must satisfy to have strong vitality.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-46919d0eebd23265d0e4a36c8561e953-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="The Issuer">
      <data key="d0">organization</data>
      <data key="d1">A provider of military-specific video command and control systems based on network communication, focused on technological and product innovation in the audio-video field. It develops audio-video system products relying on a self-developed audio-video comprehensive service platform, serves national defense command information systems, and has accumulated high-quality military customer resources. Its vision is to become a globally renowned audio-video comprehensive business supplier.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-5dd2168a3a8d8e37d073fc8d3bfdda33-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Audio-Video Comprehensive Service Platform">
      <data key="d0">artifact</data>
      <data key="d1">A self-developed platform on which the Issuer's audio-video system products rely, capable of satisfying comprehensive application needs such as video command, video conferencing, battlefield element perception, graphic and textual intelligence analysis, and presentation and control.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-5dd2168a3a8d8e37d073fc8d3bfdda33-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Cloud Federation Architecture-Based Military Video Command Platform Upgrade and Industrialization Project">
      <data key="d0">other</data>
      <data key="d1">A fundraising investment project of the Issuer with a total investment of RMB 20,658.33万元, entirely funded by raised capital.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-5dd2168a3a8d8e37d073fc8d3bfdda33-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="R&amp;D Center Construction Project">
      <data key="d0">other</data>
      <data key="d1">A fundraising investment project of the Issuer with a total investment of RMB 4,926.50万元, entirely funded by raised capital.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-5dd2168a3a8d8e37d073fc8d3bfdda33-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Supplementary Working Capital">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">A fundraising investment project of the Issuer of RMB 15,000.00万元to supplement its working capital.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-5dd2168a3a8d8e37d073fc8d3bfdda33-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Prospectus">
      <data key="d0">content</data>
      <data key="d1">The draft IPO prospectus of the Issuer, which includes details of the fundraising use in its "Section 9: Use of Raised Funds and Future Development Plan".&lt;SEP&gt;The document that discloses information about The Company, including revenue sources, cash flows, control structure, and risks.&lt;SEP&gt;An application draft prospectus, page 217, containing revenue tables by application field and quarter, and a discussion of business operations and revenue seasonality.&lt;SEP&gt;The application-draft prospectus from which the page's information is taken.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-5dd2168a3a8d8e37d073fc8d3bfdda33-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-60a51f5046e89b8028c2464899fc67ff-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6b5a5de86c5bc6e29737159f18297e8c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c5f1f19d26db208054c21fda6bfb5f71-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Shanghai Stock Exchange">
      <data key="d0">organization</data>
      <data key="d1">One of the regulatory bodies whose relevant provisions govern the handling of remaining raised funds.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-5dd2168a3a8d8e37d073fc8d3bfdda33-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="China Securities Regulatory Commission">
      <data key="d0">organization</data>
      <data key="d1">One of the regulatory bodies whose relevant provisions govern the handling of remaining raised funds.&lt;SEP&gt;The Chinese regulatory body that may recognize other pricing methods for the share issuance.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-5dd2168a3a8d8e37d073fc8d3bfdda33-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-62ddc7521474f545b02b4e88438a1830-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Military Customer Resources">
      <data key="d0">organization</data>
      <data key="d1">A large amount of high-quality military customers accumulated by the Issuer through applying its products to national defense command information systems.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-5dd2168a3a8d8e37d073fc8d3bfdda33-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Global Renowned Audio-Video Comprehensive Business Supplier">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">The vision pursued by the Issuer, which continuously explores and innovates in new technologies, new industries, new business forms, and new models.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-5dd2168a3a8d8e37d073fc8d3bfdda33-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="光谷人才创投">
      <data key="d0">organization</data>
      <data key="d1">A venture capital organization that invested in the Company. In 2017, 光谷人才创投and广垦太证invested 2,600.00万元in convertible loan form; in 2018, 光谷人才创投and广垦太证made a 2,600.00万元capital increase, with 295.00万元recorded as Share Capital and 2,305.00万元as Capital Reserve.&lt;SEP&gt;光谷人才创投is a shareholder of发行人holding 352.10万股(6.38%); it also paid new monetary capital into发行人in the August 2018 capital increase.&lt;SEP&gt;A shareholder of Issuer holding 352.10万股, representing 6.38% pre-issue and 4.78% post-issue.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-48b86756b202d4eff8360348dfcaf1f6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-904eb077d1521267f173cc1fb6ce0b18-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbb535db8e962491e19c65af8be66157-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="广垦太证">
      <data key="d0">organization</data>
      <data key="d1">A venture capital organization that co-invested with光谷人才创投in the Company. 广垦太证participated in the 2017 convertible loan investment and the 2018 capital increase.&lt;SEP&gt;广垦太证is a shareholder of发行人holding 151.90万股(2.75%); it also paid new monetary capital into发行人in the August 2018 capital increase.&lt;SEP&gt;A shareholder of Issuer holding 151.90万股, representing 2.75% pre-issue and 2.06% post-issue.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-48b86756b202d4eff8360348dfcaf1f6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-904eb077d1521267f173cc1fb6ce0b18-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbb535db8e962491e19c65af8be66157-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
