      <data key="d1">A form of investment used by光谷人才创投and广垦太证in 2017 for 2,600.00万元of investment in the Company. The Convertible Loan did not meet conversion conditions at 2017 year-end and was recorded as Other Payables; in 2018 it converted into equity.</data>
