    <node id="Military Customers">
      <data key="d0">organization</data>
      <data key="d1">Customers of The Company that are military-related; their behavior is affected by military strategic deployment, military needs, and internal plans.&lt;SEP&gt;A customer group on which the company focuses; video command control products are mainly oriented toward military customers, and the company invested limited resources into products for this group.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-60a51f5046e89b8028c2464899fc67ff-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8061e45bbab647e2bfcb8374e069e71c-chunk-000</data>
