    <node id="Seasonal Fluctuation Risk">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">The risk that The Company's operating revenue fluctuates seasonally because contract signing, delivery, and acceptance with military customers are concentrated in the second half, especially the fourth quarter.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-60a51f5046e89b8028c2464899fc67ff-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Major Shareholder Risk">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">The risk that the actual controller may use a controlling position to influence The Company's personnel and business decisions and harm The Company's interests.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-60a51f5046e89b8028c2464899fc67ff-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Management Risk">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">The risk that management quality and ability cannot adapt to rapid expansion and business development, or that organizational model and management system fail to adjust and improve timely.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-60a51f5046e89b8028c2464899fc67ff-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Management">
      <data key="d0">organization</data>
      <data key="d1">The management layer of The Company, subject to higher requirements in personnel management and capital operations as asset scale increases.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-60a51f5046e89b8028c2464899fc67ff-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Budget Management System">
      <data key="d0">method</data>
      <data key="d1">A budget management system used by the military, generally involving project budget approval in the first half of the year.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-60a51f5046e89b8028c2464899fc67ff-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Centralized Procurement System">
      <data key="d0">method</data>
      <data key="d1">A centralized procurement system used by the military, generally involving procurement implementation in the second half of the year.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-60a51f5046e89b8028c2464899fc67ff-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Issuance">
      <data key="d0">event</data>
      <data key="d1">The current issuance described in the prospectus, after which The Company's asset scale will increase substantially and the actual controller's equity ratio will decrease but remain controlling.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-60a51f5046e89b8028c2464899fc67ff-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
