      <data key="d0">artifact</data>
      <data key="d1">A product category of video early warning control systems; its 2016 revenue mainly came from orders by the Henan Province Prison System and Tarim Oilfield, and its revenue declined significantly in 2017 and 2018.&lt;SEP&gt;Products extended by the Company, including prison security emergency command platform and multimedia coordination switching platform, to meet the needs of prisons, oilfields, and other users.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-8061e45bbab647e2bfcb8374e069e71c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c54e44446e7b57bba54a81c9ed3175f-chunk-000</data>
