    <node id="补充协议二">
      <data key="d0">content</data>
      <data key="d1">The second supplemental agreement to the investment agreement, signed on 2018-07-26 by武汉光谷人才创新投资合伙企业(有限合伙), 广东广垦太证现代农业股权投资基金(有限合伙), 程家明, and武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司; it waived valuation adjustment and compensation obligations and provided for a second installment of 2,600万元to subscribe 295.00万股of the company.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-87e093f6d2db2ef50d3e42779ffe4d95-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
