      <data key="d0">content</data>
      <data key="d1">The third supplemental agreement to the investment agreement, signed on 2019-06-10 by武汉光谷人才创新投资合伙企业(有限合伙), 广东广垦太证现代农业股权投资基金(有限合伙), 程家明, and武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司; it released special clauses such as listing requirements, tag-along rights, share repurchase/acquisition, investor introduction restrictions, and priority liquidation rights.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-87e093f6d2db2ef50d3e42779ffe4d95-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
