      <data key="d0">content</data>
      <data key="d1">The验资报告(天健湘验〔2018〕27号) is the capital verification report confirming that, as of August 18, 2018, 发行人had received 2,600万元in new monetary capital contributions from光谷人才创投and广垦太证, of which 295万元was recorded as paid-in capital and 2,305万元as capital reserve.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-904eb077d1521267f173cc1fb6ce0b18-chunk-000</data>
