    </node>
    <node id="Accounts Receivable Risk">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">A risk that the Company may incur bad debts if customers default or if the Company's credit management is inadequate; the risk may increase as the Company's business scale continues to expand.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-a09a8520c26b02641cf8ce8a941b417a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Customer Credit Management System">
      <data key="d0">method</data>
      <data key="d1">A mature and comprehensive system established and strictly implemented by the Company to manage accounts receivable and customer credit.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-a09a8520c26b02641cf8ce8a941b417a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Accounts Receivable">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">Amounts owed to the Company by customers; the balances were 10.3810 million yuan at the end of 2007, 24.7400 million yuan at the end of 2008, 14.7225 million yuan at the end of 2009, and 13.3039 million yuan on June 30, 2010.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-a09a8520c26b02641cf8ce8a941b417a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Customer Default">
      <data key="d0">event</data>
      <data key="d1">A customer's failure to fulfill payment obligations, which can contribute to bad debt risk for the Company.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-a09a8520c26b02641cf8ce8a941b417a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Bad Debt Risk">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">A risk that accounts receivable become uncollectible, potentially arising from customer default or inadequate credit management.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-a09a8520c26b02641cf8ce8a941b417a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Exchange Rate Risk">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">A risk to the Company's operations and earnings caused by uncertain exchange rate changes influenced by domestic and international political and economic factors.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-a09a8520c26b02641cf8ce8a941b417a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Foreign Exchange Receipts and Payments">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">The Company's foreign currency receipts and payments, mainly related to imports of IC and electronic components and overseas sales, involving currencies such as US dollars and Hong Kong dollars.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-a09a8520c26b02641cf8ce8a941b417a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="IC and Electronic Components">
      <data key="d0">artifact</data>
      <data key="d1">Products involved in the Company's imports and overseas sales, with foreign exchange receipts and payments mainly covering their import and overseas sale.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-a09a8520c26b02641cf8ce8a941b417a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Overseas Sales">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">Sales made outside China that are part of the Company's foreign exchange receipts and payments.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-a09a8520c26b02641cf8ce8a941b417a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="US Dollar">
      <data key="d0">other</data>
      <data key="d1">A currency involved in the Company's foreign exchange receipts and payments.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-a09a8520c26b02641cf8ce8a941b417a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Hong Kong Dollar">
      <data key="d0">other</data>
      <data key="d1">A currency involved in the Company's foreign exchange receipts and payments.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-a09a8520c26b02641cf8ce8a941b417a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="China">
      <data key="d0">location</data>
      <data key="d1">The country that currently implements a managed floating exchange rate system.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-a09a8520c26b02641cf8ce8a941b417a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Managed Floating Exchange Rate System">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">The exchange rate regime currently implemented by China.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-a09a8520c26b02641cf8ce8a941b417a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="RMB Exchange Rate">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">The exchange rate of the renminbi, described as relatively stable at the time but subject to uncertainty due to domestic and international political and economic factors.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-a09a8520c26b02641cf8ce8a941b417a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Pricing Strategy">
      <data key="d0">method</data>
      <data key="d1">The Company's strategy of determining sales prices based on foreign exchange purchase prices.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-a09a8520c26b02641cf8ce8a941b417a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Political and Economic Factors">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">Domestic and international political and economic factors that influence exchange rate changes and create uncertainty.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-a09a8520c26b02641cf8ce8a941b417a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Fundraising Investment Projects">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">Projects to be invested with funds raised in the offering: Warehousing and Logistics Center, R&amp;D Center, E-Commerce Platform, Expansion of Product Variety and Quantity, and Other Working Capital Related to the Main Business.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-a09a8520c26b02641cf8ce8a941b417a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="E-Commerce Platform">
      <data key="d0">artifact</data>
      <data key="d1">A fundraising investment project of the Company.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-a09a8520c26b02641cf8ce8a941b417a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Expansion of Product Variety and Quantity">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">A fundraising investment project of the Company.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-a09a8520c26b02641cf8ce8a941b417a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Other Working Capital Related to the Main Business">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">A fundraising investment project of the Company covering other working capital related to the main business.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-a09a8520c26b02641cf8ce8a941b417a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Management Capability">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">The Company's ability to manage operations; if it cannot improve correspondingly, the fundraising investment projects may fail to reach expected targets or harm the existing management system.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-a09a8520c26b02641cf8ce8a941b417a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="New Product Lines">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">Additional product lines about which the Company must make correct directional judgments to avoid major strategic errors affecting fundraising investment projects.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-a09a8520c26b02641cf8ce8a941b417a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Fixed Assets">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">Assets of the Company; as of June 30, 2010, fixed assets were 3.2263 million yuan, and total fixed asset investment in the fundraising investment projects is 74.1256 million yuan.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-a09a8520c26b02641cf8ce8a941b417a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Depreciation Expenses">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">Expenses arising from depreciation of fixed assets; they will rise substantially after the fundraising investment projects are completed.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-a09a8520c26b02641cf8ce8a941b417a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Profit Decline Risk">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">A risk that increased fixed asset depreciation expenses cause profit to decline if the fundraising investment projects cannot achieve expected benefits.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-a09a8520c26b02641cf8ce8a941b417a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Operating Performance">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">The Company's business results, which may be adversely affected if the fundraising investment projects cannot achieve expected benefits.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-a09a8520c26b02641cf8ce8a941b417a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Expected Benefits">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">The benefits expected from the fundraising investment projects, which may not be realized if management capability does not improve or if product-line judgments are wrong.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-a09a8520c26b02641cf8ce8a941b417a-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d3">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Military Informatization Construction">
      <data key="d0">concept</data>
      <data key="d1">The ongoing upgrade of military informatization; together with deepening military reform, it increases the competitiveness and recognition of the Company's products in the military.</data>
      <data key="d2">doc-afb452c25941d560d1baf469f525d4a8-chunk-000</data>
